<template><main class="page"><el-card><template #header><div class="header"><b>忆路银龄 · 工作台</b><el-button @click="logout">退出</el-button></div></template><h2>欢迎回来，{{store.user?.realName||store.user?.username}}</h2><p>当前用户：{{store.user?.username}}</p><div class="status"><strong>AI模型：{{aiStatus.provider||'加载中'}}</strong><span>知识库：{{aiStatus.knowledgeBase==='CONNECTED'?'已连接':'未连接'}}</span><span>状态：{{aiStatus.available?'在线':'Mock/待配置'}}</span></div><p>AI养老金融助手会结合您的养老画像提供更贴合的知识陪伴。</p><div class="actions"><el-button type="success" size="large" @click="router.push('/agent')">AI决策中心</el-button><el-button type="success" plain size="large" @click="router.push('/health-score')">金融健康分析</el-button><el-button type="success" plain size="large" @click="router.push('/financial')">AI养老金融规划</el-button><el-button type="primary" size="large" @click="router.push('/assistant')">AI养老金融助手</el-button><el-button size="large" @click="router.push('/profile')">我的养老画像</el-button><el-button type="warning" size="large" @click="router.push('/fraud')">诈骗风险检测</el-button><el-button v-if="store.user?.username==='admin'" type="info" size="large" @click="router.push('/admin')">管理端Dashboard</el-button></div></el-card></main></template>
<script setup lang="ts">import {onMounted,reactive} from 'vue';import {useRouter} from 'vue-router';import {useAuthStore} from '../stores/auth';import {getAiStatus} from '../api/ai';const store=useAuthStore(),router=useRouter(),aiStatus=reactive({provider:'',available:false,knowledgeBase:''});onMounted(async()=>{if(!store.token)router.push('/login');else {if(!store.user)await store.load().catch(()=>router.push('/login'));try{const r:any=await getAiStatus();Object.assign(aiStatus,r.data.data)}catch{}}});function logout(){store.signOut();router.push('/login')}</script>
<style scoped>.page{padding:48px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.status{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px;background:#f0f7ff;color:#24557a;font-size:18px}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}</style>
